~ start
if QuestService.is_completed_offered()
	=> completed
elif QuestService.is_ready_offered()
	=> ready
elif QuestService.is_accepted_offered()
	=> in_progress
else
	Giver: Bring me one proof token from the far-corner critter.
	- I will fetch a token.
		do QuestService.request_accept_offered()
		Giver: It keeps to the south-east. Do not wander the slime pond.
		=> END
	- Not now.
		Giver: The errand can wait.
		=> END

~ in_progress
Giver: The proof token still sits on that critter.
=> END

~ ready
Giver: That is the token. I will take it.
- Turn in the errand.
	do QuestService.request_turn_in_offered()
	=> END
- Keep it.
	=> END

~ completed
Giver: The proof chain is done.
=> END
